OL,3,GNEWSAPolice donate drones to search and
OL,4,Arescue teams
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has donated three drones
OL,7,Fto a search and rescue team who help
OL,8,Fthem look for missing and injured
OL,9,Fpeople.
OL,11,FDevon and Cornwall Police donated the
OL,12,Fdrones to Peninsula Search and Rescue
OL,13,F(PenSAR), the regional body of Mountain
OL,14,FRescue for all the voluntary search and
OL,15,Frescue teams in the South West.
OL,17,FThe donated drones had been with the
OL,18,Fpolice force for three years and have
OL,19,Fcapability to fly in strong winds and
OL,20,Frain.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
