OL,3,GNEWSAPolice donate drones to search and
OL,4,Arescue teams
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlec Collyer, drone officer for PenSAR,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We have a number of drones, but
OL,8,Fthey tend to be the smaller ones, safe
OL,9,Fto fly near people."
